# Admin Dashboard (stunning-dollop)
#
# Local dev: leave unset — Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:3000
#
# Vercel production: leave unset — build uses https://breww-ysqj.onrender.com automatically
# Only set this if your backend URL is different:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#
# IMPORTANT: Never set VITE_API_BASE_URL to a vercel.app URL (causes DEPLOYMENT_NOT_FOUND)
